  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eth 214.01 How Adopted. A committee rule, or any amendment or repeal thereof, shall be proposed, adopted, and filed in accordance with RSA 541-A.\n\nSource. #12617-A, eff 9-6-18",
